# Every production ladder under Answering::Any, keyed by its function, with
# its pin or its row (scripts/gates/any-climb-pins.sh):
#   <file> <fn> <count> pin <test fn>   a test reading the production function
#                                       with a kept reading ahead of an answer
#                                       (or two kept readings ranked), red under
#                                       a first-refusal loop;
#   <file> <fn> <count> row <row id>    no cheap fixture: the row names the one
#                                       its pin needs.
# A new Any ladder reds until it is named here.
crates/geom-brep/src/chart_singularity.rs holds 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/geom-brep/src/edge_nurbs.rs measured_ends 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/geom-brep/src/props/curved.rs pole_side 1 pin an_arc_holding_the_pole_answers_past_an_arc_in_band
crates/geom-brep/src/props/curved.rs sphere_region_material_sign 1 pin a_member_arc_holding_the_pole_answers_past_one_in_band
crates/profile/src/seg.rs arc_arc 1 pin an_end_inside_answers_past_an_end_in_band
crates/topo/src/boolean/carrier_touch.rs ball_off_face 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/topo/src/boolean/carrier_touch.rs off_face 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/topo/src/boolean/contain.rs loop_circle 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/topo/src/boolean/fate.rs rehome 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/topo/src/boolean/insert.rs held_cut 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/topo/src/boolean/overlap.rs any_corner_meets 1 pin a_corner_that_meets_answers_past_one_in_band
crates/topo/src/boolean/region.rs on_boundary 1 pin an_edge_holding_the_point_answers_past_one_in_band
crates/topo/src/boolean/rim_wedge.rs departures 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/topo/src/boolean/rim_wedge.rs rim_exists 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/topo/src/boolean/sectors.rs crescent 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/topo/src/boolean/sectors.rs rays_within 1 pin a_sector_not_holding_the_line_answers_past_one_in_band
# pieces_hold: holding's ladder over its pieces, its readings stubbed.
crates/topo/src/boolean/slit.rs pieces_hold 1 pin an_unread_piece_refuses_ahead_of_an_earlier_in_band_one
crates/topo/src/boolean/solid_contain.rs point_in_faces 1 pin a_face_holding_the_point_answers_past_a_face_in_band
crates/topo/src/census.rs arc_interiors_meet 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
# search_meeting: the one ladder shared_run, planar_interiors_meet and
# shared_interior_witness search their probes through, its rungs stubbed.
crates/topo/src/census.rs search_meeting 1 pin an_unbuilt_reading_outranks_an_undecided_one_in_either_order
crates/topo/src/census.rs probe_vertices 1 pin an_abort_stops_the_probe_and_a_limit_outranks_in_band
crates/topo/src/census.rs span_clear 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
# wedges_overlap: its pair ladder and each pair's probe ladder, both read
# by the production function in the one module.
crates/topo/src/census.rs wedges_overlap 2 pin a_pair_whose_wedge_does_not_read_is_kept_and_a_later_pair_answers
# lone_ring_outer_side: holds_outer's ladder over the outer loop's points.
crates/topo/src/chord_join.rs lone_ring_outer_side 1 pin a_point_in_band_of_a_lone_rings_plane_hands_the_side_to_the_next
# path_ring_side: cone_ring_rows reads the outer reader at every offset,
# among them offsets whose first path is in band, and holds its answer; a
# first-refusal ladder refuses there. paths_rung is read on the rung
# itself: through read_paths, the agreeing ladder over the outer
# references answers from another reference past it.
crates/topo/src/chord_join.rs path_ring_side 1 pin a_path_escalating_by_a_corner_hands_re_homing_to_the_next
crates/topo/src/chord_join.rs paths_rung 1 pin a_path_in_band_hands_the_rung_to_the_next_path
crates/topo/src/chord_join.rs ring_side 1 pin a_planar_ring_vertex_escalating_hands_re_homing_to_the_next
